**Read:** [Ironmaking and Steelmaking — Gour Gopal Roy, NPTEL](../sources/Ironmaking-and-Steelmaking-NPTEL.lingua#r_0XJNFP35VJ24ZR6AZJ78EY03G0), the whole course; [Steel Making — Dipak Mazumdar and Satish Ch. Koria, NPTEL](../sources/Steel-Making-Mazumdar-Koria.lingua#r_37SE3PY3C4WDRFHWQ39PDMXEYQ), the whole course; [Iron and Steel Production — European Commission BREF](../sources/Iron-and-Steel-Production-BREF.lingua#r_1R9HC6SENF991ZZQA5WKH2C8HD), the entire document; [Ferrous Metals Processing Industry — European Commission BREF](../sources/Ferrous-Metals-Processing-BREF.lingua#r_49RSZE1MH5VHM49SDAXFQGHWRD), all complete applicable downstream chapters; [Metals, alloys, steels, and graduate modeling — Bhadeshia teaching materials](../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F), the full relevant advanced steel and transformation work; [Steels: Structure, Properties, and Design — Bhadeshia and Honeycombe](../sources/Steels-Structure-Properties-and-Design.lingua#r_5CB9R75MR8424M7VJ5Y33FY0QF), the whole book as further professional study, when available.

Read the complete iron/steel public courses and the entire iron/steel BREF. Select a full integrated route and a substantive alternative involving different feed/reduction or steelmaking arrangements. Define final product composition, structural state, geometry, surface, tests, and use so the routes are compared on equivalent useful outcomes.

Connect burden/feed characterization, reduction, gas/thermal systems, steelmaking, slag/gas/impurity control, secondary treatment, casting, thermomechanical/heat processing, inspection, utilities, residuals, maintenance, and coordinated work. Preserve compatible boundaries, time, reference states, material identities, inventory, and uncertainty.

Independently reproduce significant material/energy and reactor/phase or transformation calculations. Compare modeled trajectories with primary operating or supplied observations and a separate condition. Test a changed ore/scrap impurity distribution, altered energy/gas supply, and production/grade-transition or interruption behavior.

**Work:** produce a substantial design/operation/product study with alternatives, derivations, original calculations, independent checks, failures/disagreements, and defended conclusions. Use measured structure/property evidence to test the claimed product quality rather than ending at a liquid-metal assay. Explain what further practical laboratory, plant, or research evidence is needed for consequential unresolved claims and how another team would continue the monitoring, maintenance, and knowledge work.

**Continue:** [Connect aluminium chemistry, electrolysis/recovery, fabrication, and function in one defended study](Advanced-aluminium-primary-secondary-and-fabricated-product-study.lingua#r_5WE5EH7ZQS6EJPR9T429ZMRXTY).

